 ],
 "strings": {
  "Everyone on the force respects him.\nHe's an unquestionable leader.": "",
  "So then... Morita blames Alzheimer's for all\nthe suffering his family faced.": "",
  "So then... Morita blames Alzheimer's for\nall the suffering his family faced.": "",
  "Most likely, yes.": "",
  "The tragedy could have been prevented\nif only AD-9 had existed at the time.": "",
  "And if AD-9 had existed,\nthey'd have been fine.": "",
  "And once it does, who knows how many situations\njust like it could be avoided?": "",
  "Countless other families would be fine too.\nAD-9 would put a stop to all that.": "",
  "With a tragedy like that...\nNo wonder he's defending it.": "",
  "With all that behind him...\nmaybe that's why he defends it.": "",
  "He's sure as hell not in it for the cash.\nNot for reputation either.": "",
  "Guy's just doin' what he thinks\nneeds to be done.": "",
  "I suppose I can understand that.": "",
  "Hm? You can?": "",
  "Oh? Can you?": "",
  "You think that excuses\neverything that monster has done?": "",
  "You think that excuses everything\nthat monster has done?": "",
  "He framed Ayabe. Turned a blind eye to\nEmi-chan's murder. Left Okubo-kun out in the cold.": "",
  "He framed Ayabe. Turned a blind eye to\nEmi-chan's murder. Left Okubo-kun to rot.": "",
  "All because this fucking drug\nneeds to get fast-tracked!?": "",
  "All for the sake of this\none fucking drug!": "",
  "How can you begin to think\nthat's right!? How!?": "",
  "If Morita can decide what\n\"needs to be done\", then so can we.": "",
  "Morita may have his ideals,\nbut so do I.": "",
  "I'm gonna protect every last person they've\ntrampled. I'm gonna get revenge for Emi-chan.": "",
  "I'm going to protect everyone they've trampled.\nAnd I'm going to avenge Emi-chan.": "",
  "What is?": "",
  "Oh, it's just... really obvious\nyou used to be a lawyer.": "",
  "Used to?\nI've still got my badge.": "",
  "I still am.\nGot my badge and everything.": "",
  "Heh, yeah that's right.": "",
  "Heh. I remember it.": "",
  "Hey, lay off the gamblin', yeah?\nYa lose more than you win.": "",
  "Hey, lay off the gamblin', yeah?\nYou'd be better off without it.": "",
  "Whatever you say.": "",
  "Lay off.": "",
  "Yagami-kun. I think it'd be best\nif you hold onto these files.": "",
  "Here, take this... I think it belongs\nin your hands, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "Yo Tak.": "",
  "Make sure she gets\nhome safe, would ya?": "",
  "Make sure Mafuyu gets home safe.": "",
  "Um... Can you walk me to a taxi?\nSorry to intrude.": "",
  "Um... Can you walk with me to a taxi?\nSorry to impose...": "",
  "Hey, since we're close,\ndo you mind if we drop in on Saori?": "",
  "Oh... hey, do you mind if we stop by\nto see Saori?": "",
  "Oh sure, what's up?": "",
  "Oh, no reason, she just likes seeing\nthe two of us together.": "",
  "Well, she just likes seeing\nthe two of us together.": "",
  "Uhh... What now?": "",
  "Eh, whatever. I was gonna go fill her in\non what happened tonight anyway.": "",
  "Eh, whatever. I was gonna go let Saori-san know\nwhat happened tonight anyway.": "",
  "Kido never would've ended up in Kamurocho\nif not for Saori... and her honey trap.": "",
  "Kido never would've ended up in Kamurocho\nif not for Saori-san... and her honey trap.": "",
  "A honey trap?\nYou can't be serious.": "",
  "Her what? You're joking!": "",
  "Ah!?": "",
  "Oh, I, uh...!": "",
  "Oh, whoaaa!": "",
  "Yagami-san! I didn't realize\nyou'd be stopping by...": "",
  "Yagami-san! I didn't know you\nwere coming! U-Um...": "",
  "Awfully suspicious! Just what\nwere you two up to in here?": "",
  "Oh yeah? Just what were you two\nup to, anyway?": "",
  "Er, not much...": "",
  "Guess we should go then.": "",
  "Maybe we should go, Mafuyu.": "",
  "I think we're kinda ruining the mood.": "",
  "Hey, how did everything go with Kido?": "",
  "Wait. How did everything\ngo with Kido?": "",
  "Hold on. I wanna know what\nyou two were up to first.": "",
  "Oh, right. First, why don't you tell me\nwhat we just walked in on?": "",
  "Well, Hoshino-kun was just—": "",
  "What, this? Hoshino-kun was just—": "",
  "Okay, okay, okay! This is all just\na big misunderstanding! Or... maybe not?": "",
  "Hoooold on! It's not's like that!\nOr... maybe it is!?": "",
  "Or maybe it is!?": "",
  "Maybe it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>isn't</font_kind>!": "",
  "Maybe you'll get further next time.": "",
  "Better luck next time.": "",
  "Is it just me,\nor is Saori-san enjoying this?": "",
  "Is it just me, or is Saori-san\nenjoying this...?": "",
  "Oh yeah.": "",
  "I've heard. It's horrible what happened\nto Morita's mother.": "",
  "I remember hearing about that.\nIt's horrible what happened to Morita's mother.": "",
  "So the prosecution is all\nworking to protect AD-9...?": "",
  "So it's all connected? The prosecutors\nare working to protect AD-9...?": "",
  "The chief prosecutor is, at the very least.": "",
  "The chief prosecutor is, at least.": "",
  "(He's the one who stepped in and\nkicked us out of Shono's lab.)": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He and Ichinose stepped in and kicked us out\nof Shono's lab, after all.)</color>": "",
  "This is all my fault. I'm the one who told\nMorita that Yagami-kun would be there.": "",
  "When Yagami called me from the lab,\nI thought telling Morita would help...": "",
  "If I had only gone to Izumida instead...": "",
  "It's my fault. If I had only\ngone to Izumida...": "",
  "Don't think like that.\nThere's no knowing who's on what side.": "",
  "No... we don't know if Izumida's\non their side either.": "",
  "We can't trust anyone\nexcept ourselves.": "",
  "Um, can I say something real quick?": "",
  "Um, do you mind if I say something?": "",
  "I'm not sure I'm the best person to be\ndefending Ayabe. Not against an enemy this powerful.": "",
  "With all we're up against, am I really the right lawyer for this?\nDefending Ayabe, I mean?": "",
  "Huh? What's up?": "",
  "Agreed, Hoshino-kun can't handle the pressure.\nIt has to be you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hoshino-kun can't handle the pressure.\nIt has to be you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Haha, real funny.": "",
  "Look, this is no time for jokes.": "",
  "This isn't a joke.\nWe're dead serious.": "",
  "Don't just dismiss them.\nIt's not a joke.": "",
  "Please, Yagami-san. We're going up against\nthe people who murdered Emi-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san... We're facing AD-9's masterminds.\nThe ones who murdered Emi-san.": "",
  "Do it for her.\nFor Okubo-san.": "",
  "This would be for\nEmi-san and Okubo-san.": "",
  "And for Shintani-sensei.": "",
  "It's time for you to show the world\nwhat you think is right.": "",
  "Like you said. If you want to show the world\nyour ideals, now's the time.": "",
  "No more running.": "",
  "I'll let Genda-sensei and Ayabe-san\nknow right away.": "",
  "I'll let Genda-sensei and Ayabe-san know\nright away.": "",
  "This is bound to make headlines.\nI can see it now...": "",
  "Just imagine! This might even\nmake headlines, right?": "",
  "Disgraced lawyer Yagami-sensei\nmakes his triumphant courtroom return...": "",
  "\"Disgraced lawyer Yagami-san makes his\ntriumphant courtroom return\"...": "",
  "All right, do we really need the \"disgraced\" part?": "",
  "...Maybe just lead with Yagami-san.": "",
  "But... all right.\nIf they both agree, I'll defend Ayabe.": "",
  "But all right. If they both agree,\nI'll defend Ayabe. As a lawyer.": "",
  "Guess I'll need to start digging\nup some more evidence...": "",
  "Guess I'll need to start digging up\nsome more evidence...": "",
  "Leaving, Yagami-kun?\nI'll join you.": "",
  "Leaving already? I'll join you.": "",
  "Shall we? Can you stay with me\nuntil I find my taxi?": "",
  "Let's go. Can you stay with me\nuntil I find my taxi?": "",
  "You walk Mafuyu to her taxi, okay?": "",
  "Mafuyu's waiting. Go walk her\nto her taxi, okay?": "",
  "Um, about what you saw just now...": "",
  "You mean the hand-holding thing?": "",
  "Mm? You two holding hands?": "",
  "Please don't tell Genda-sensei.\nI don't want things to be awkward.": "",
  "W-Well... please don't tell Genda-sensei.\nI don't want things to be awkward.": "",
  "Where are you going?": "",
  "The taxi stop is closer\nif we go the other way.": "",
  "There's a closer taxi over this way.": "",
  "Thank you for helping me tonight, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "Thank you for helping me tonight,\nYagami-kun.": "",
  "Huh? One second.": "",
  "It's Izumida. Now that I think about it,\nhe left a message earlier, too.": "",
  "Did you listen to it?": "",
  "Yes, he said he wanted to talk.\nIt sounds like he's at Mijore.": "",
  "Mijore, huh?\nGuess he wanted coffee instead of booze.": "",
  "Mijore, huh...? Must be serious if it's\nover coffee instead of drinks.": "",
  "You don't have to do anything.\nGo home, where you're safe.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>You</font_kind> don't have to do anything.\nGo home, where you're safe.": "",
  "Izumida might be on their side, too.": "",
  "I'll go instead.": "",
  "I'll take your place.": "",
  "You... really?": "",
  "All right.\nStay safe out there.": "",
  "All right. Don't do anything reckless.": "",
  "Yagami?\nWhat are you doing here!?": "",
  "What the... Yagami?\nWhat are you doing here!?": "",
  "Did you come alone?": "",
  "You here alone?": "",
  "Good. I sent Mafuyu home.\nI could go for a chat and a coffee, though.": "",
  "I sent Mafuyu home.\nI'm up for a chat over coffee, though.": "",
  "Sorry, not interested.": "",
  "What did you have to tell Mafuyu?": "",
  "It has nothing to do with you.": "",
  "Then how about I guess?": "",
  "How 'bout I guess?": "",
  "The reason you wanted\nto talk to her was...": "",
  "The reason you wanted to\ntalk to Mafuyu was...": "",
  "You were gonna confess your love, right?": "",
  "You were gonna confess, right?": "",
  "C'mon, man.\nBe professional.": "",
  "You idiot.\nNow's no time for your jokes.": "",
  "You idiot. This is no time for jokes.": "",
  "No? In that case...": "",
  "No? Then...": "",
  "You were gonna tell her\nto join forces with Morita.": "",
  "You were gonna tell her to\njoin forces with Morita.": "",
  "You were gonna complain about work.": "",
  "Hmph. That's not too far off.": "",
  "The boss got you down?": "",
  "What, badmouthing your boss?": "",
  "Maybe a few choice words\nabout what Morita did today?": "",
  "You wouldn't have some comments\non Morita's behavior... right?": "",
  "I see what you're getting at.": "",
  "...I see what you're getting at.": "",
  "What happened with the chief prosecutor and that\nMinistry of Health bureaucrat... It wasn't normal.": "",
  "Before... What happened with the chief prosecutor\nand that Ministry bureaucrat... It wasn't normal.": "",
  "Not normal?\nThat's a bit of an understatement. ": "",
  "Not normal? That's a bit of\nan understatement. ": "",
  "They want to protect AD-9 so bad, they ignored\nevidence of a murder under their noses.": "",
  "They're so focused on protecting AD-9,\nthey ignored clear evidence of murder.": "",
  "You're working with them too, aren't you?": "",
  "You in on it too?": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita is part of a conspiracy\nto push AD-9 through, no matter the cost.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor Morita is entangled in\na conspiracy around AD-9.": "",
  "Do you have proof of that?": "",
  "This. I got it from Mafuyu.": "",
  "I've got this.\nMafuyu gave it to me.": "",
  "It's a case file detailing a domestic murder\nwithin Morita's family. Sound familiar?": "",
  "Ten years ago, there was a domestic murder in Morita's family.\nSound familiar?": "",
  "This is the first I'm hearing of it.": "",
  "No... I had no idea.": "",
  "I'll give it to you...\nif you have the strength to fight.": "",
  "Take it... if you think you'll\nhave the strength to fight.": "",
  "What happens if you find out\nI'm telling the truth?": "",
  "How far will you go, Izumida?": "",
  "How far will you go?": "",
  "Would you be willing to bring\nyour own boss to justice?": "",
  "Can you confront your own boss?\nBring him to justice?": "",
  "Of course. Ask a hundred prosecutors,\nand they'd answer the same way.": "",
  "Of course. Ask a hundred prosecutors,\nthey'd tell you the same.": "",
  "Huh. Maybe you're not\nas bad as I thought.": "",
  "...Maybe you're not so bad.": "",
  "This incident is what gave Morita motivation\nto support AD-9. That's how I see it, at least.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Heh, glad Izumida's loyalty lies with the law.)</color>": "",
  "This is tragic...": "",
  "This is horrible...": "",
  "Yeah. His sick mom,\nstrangled to death by his own brother...": "",
  "Homicide in his own family.\nA caretaker murder.": "",
  "Morita's doing what he thinks is right in all this.\nThat's why he suppressed evidence earlier.": "",
  "Morita's doing what he thinks is right in all this.\nLike earlier... He'll even suppress evidence for it.": "",
  "Back at Shono's lab, I mean.": "",
  "What you saw at Shono's lab.": "",
  "The Mole killed countless people there.\nIt's only natural there'd be traces left behind.": "",
  "It's all there. That place has all the evidence\nof the Mole's murders.": "",
  "Our case would be practically\nbulletproof if we found them.": "",
  "If we had that, our case\nwould be bulletproof.": "",
  "It's just...\nI can't believe he would do this...": "",
  "I just... He would go that far?\nThat's...": "",
  "The way he acted at the lab, we have to believe\nhe's wrapped up in this. Wouldn't you agree?": "",
  "You saw him at the lab. He's at the center of this.\nDon't you think?": "",
  "Izumida!": "",
  "Well?": "",
  "I... I guess I can't deny that.": "",
  "I suppose... I can't deny that.": "",
  "But if he really is trying\nto protect AD-9...": "",
  "But... if he really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind>\ntrying to protect AD-9...": "",
  "How do we stop him?\nWhat can we even do?": "",
  "Well, I was planning to use Ayabe's trial to bring\nall the dark truths about AD-9 out into the light.": "",
  "I had a plan. I was planning to use Ayabe's trial\nto bring all the dark truths of AD-9 into the light.": "",
  "That's why I chased Hamura down.\nWhy I needed to find Shono's lab.": "",
  "That's why I did all of this. Chasing Hamura down,\nsearching for Shono's lab...": "",
  "But Ichinose and Morita crushed those leads\nbefore they really even took off.": "",
  "But Ichinose and Morita just\ncrushed those leads.": "",
  "And you don't have\nthe ammo to stop them.": "",
  "And on your own, you don't have\nthe ammo to stop them.": "",
  "It hurts to hear the truth\nlaid out like that.": "",
  "Hurts to hear the truth\nlaid out like that.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "What is?": "อะไรนะ?",
  "Whatever you say.": "แล้วแต่นายเลย",
  "Ah!?": "อ๊ะ!?",
  "Oh yeah.": "อ้อ ใช่สิ",
  "Huh? What's up?": "หา? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Where are you going?": "จะไปไหนน่ะ?",
  "Sorry, not interested.": "ขอโทษนะ ไม่สนใจ",
  "Well?": "เป็นไงบ้าง?"
 }
}
